pro_course_detail.description:
Students who wish to utilize and enhance their speaking (and listening) abilities typically enroll in this discussion course.

Objectives

The goal of this course is to help students improve their English communication abilities by:

- improving fluency through regular speaking activities; 
- expanding vocabulary through discussions, role-plays, presentations on a variety of topics; 
- and developing a solid understanding of oral English communication, as well as basic structures, taught not through explicit conceptual structured teachings, but through communication
